---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service | Kubeletto" description="Terms of Service for Kubeletto - Cloud deployment platform">
  <div class="legal-page">
    <!-- Decorative shapes like hero -->
    <div class="page-shapes" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="shape shape-1"></div>
      <div class="shape shape-2"></div>
    </div>

    <main class="legal-main">
      <div class="legal-header">
        <a href="/" class="back-link">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"></polyline></svg>
          Back to Home
        </a>
        <p class="legal-label">Legal</p>
        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: December 27, 2025</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-content">
        <div class="legal-card">
          <section>
            <h2>1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
            <p>By accessing or using Kubeletto's services, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you disagree with any part of these terms, you may not access our services.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
            <p>Kubeletto provides a cloud deployment platform that enables developers to deploy, manage, and scale applications. Our services include:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Automated application deployment from Git repositories</li>
              <li>Container orchestration and management</li>
              <li>Custom domain configuration</li>
              <li>Application monitoring and logging</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>3. Subscription and Payments</h2>
            <p>Kubeletto offers subscription-based pricing plans:</p>
            <div class="pricing-summary">
              <div class="plan-item">
                <span class="plan-name">Starter Plan</span>
                <span class="plan-price">$3/month</span>
                <span class="plan-desc">1 project, shared resources</span>
              </div>
              <div class="plan-item featured">
                <span class="plan-name">Pro Plan</span>
                <span class="plan-price">$9/month</span>
                <span class="plan-desc">Unlimited projects, dedicated resources</span>
              </div>
              <div class="plan-item">
                <span class="plan-name">Enterprise</span>
                <span class="plan-price">Custom</span>
                <span class="plan-desc">Contact sales for details</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p>Payments are processed securely through <strong>Xendit</strong>. By subscribing, you authorize us to charge your payment method on a recurring monthly basis until you cancel your subscription.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>4. Billing and Cancellation</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>Subscriptions are billed monthly in advance</li>
              <li>You may cancel your subscription at any time through your account settings</li>
              <li>Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current billing period</li>
              <li>No refunds are provided for partial months</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>5. User Responsibilities</h2>
            <p>You agree to:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Provide accurate account information</li>
              <li>Maintain the security of your account credentials</li>
              <li>Not use the service for any illegal or unauthorized purpose</li>
              <li>Comply with all applicable laws and regulations</li>
              <li>Not deploy malicious software or content</li>
            </ul>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>6. Service Availability</h2>
            <p>We strive to provide 99.9% uptime for our services. However, we do not guarantee uninterrupted access and may perform maintenance that temporarily affects service availability.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p>Kubeletto shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages resulting from your use of or inability to use the service.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>8. Termination</h2>
            <p>We may terminate or suspend your account immediately, without prior notice, for conduct that we believe violates these Terms or is harmful to other users, us, or third parties.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>9. Changes to Terms</h2>
            <p>We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. We will provide notice of significant changes by posting the new Terms on this page.</p>
          </section>

          <section>
            <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us:</p>
            <div class="contact-box">
              <p><strong>Email:</strong> support@kubeletto.com</p>
              <p><strong>Phone:</strong> +62 812 3456 7890</p>
              <p><strong>Address:</strong> Jakarta, Indonesia</p>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </div>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--paper) 0%, #f8f9fa 100%);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Decorative shapes */
  .page-shapes {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .shape {
    position: absolute;
    border-radius: 50%;
    opacity: 0.03;
    background: var(--ink);
  }

  .shape-1 {
    width: 500px;
    height: 500px;
    top: -100px;
    right: -100px;
  }

  .shape-2 {
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    bottom: 20%;
    left: -50px;
  }

  .legal-main {
    margin-left: var(--nav-width);
    padding: 4rem 4rem 6rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
  }

  .legal-header {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--steel);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    transition: all 0.3s var(--ease-out-expo);
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 100px;
    background: var(--glass);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid var(--steel-light);
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--paper);
    transform: translateX(-4px);
  }

  .back-link svg {
    width: 1rem;
    height: 1rem;
  }

  .legal-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--steel);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .legal-updated {
    color: var(--steel);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .legal-content {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .legal-card {
    background: var(--paper);
    border-radius: 24px;
    padding: 3rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    border: 1px solid var(--steel-light);
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 2.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--steel-light);
  }

  section:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  p {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  ul {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.8;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  li::marker {
    color: var(--blue);
  }

  strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .pricing-summary {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .plan-item {
    background: #f8f9fa;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    text-align: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--steel-light);
    transition: all 0.3s var(--ease-out-expo);
  }

  .plan-item.featured {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    border-color: var(--ink);
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .plan-item.featured .plan-name,
  .plan-item.featured .plan-price {
    color: var(--paper);
  }

  .plan-item.featured .plan-desc {
    color: var(--steel);
  }

  .plan-name {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--steel);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .plan-price {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .plan-desc {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--steel);
  }

  .contact-box {
    background: #f8f9fa;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--steel-light);
  }

  .contact-box p {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .contact-box p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .legal-main {
      margin-left: 0;
      padding: 2rem;
    }

    .legal-card {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }

    .pricing-summary {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .plan-item.featured {
      transform: none;
    }
  }
</style>
